The sun is down, and the moon is up,
And the stars are shining in the sky ;
The birds are singing in the trees,
And the flowers are blooming on the ground ;
The wind is blowing in the trees,
And the leaves are rustling in the air ;
The clouds are floating in the sky,
And the rain is falling on the ground ;

